DATA;
/* Single CARTESIAN_POINT; surface collapses to this point. */
#10=CARTESIAN_POINT('p_degenerate',(1.0,2.0,3.0));
/* Defect: B_SPLINE_SURFACE_WITH_KNOTS degree (3,3) but only 1x1 net.
   Knot vectors have multiplicity (2,2) at each end (no interior knots).
   With 1 control point, degree 3 requires at least degree+1=4 points per axis.
   This is geometrically degenerate and should be rejected. */
